&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€66.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€88.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Firefox

Senior Technical Business Analyst &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company &lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the role and team:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CreateFuture is looking for a collaborative, technically grounded Senior Business Analyst to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Senior Business Analysts drive high-impact change across a broad spectrum of client engagements. While we deliver end-to-end digital products, this role is tailored for a BA who is as comfortable driving complex back-end environments (such as API integrations, platform migrations, data architecture, and system integration logic) as they are crafting front-end user experiences and feature specifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll leverage your proficiency in business analysis, system architecture, and product strategy to guide project development, acting as the crucial bridge between technical and non-technical stakeholders. Your responsibilities span meticulous requirements analysis, data flow mapping, estimation, and championing delivery best practices within your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your exceptional communication skills are pivotal for translating complex client objectives into clear, developer-ready specifications and data flows, ensuring what we build is both valuable for users and technically robust under the hood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does this sound like you? Do you have a passion for the craft of Business Analysis, a natural curiosity for how complex backend systems work, and an interest in how modern tools are changing how we work? If so, we’d love to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate current and emerging business procedures, collaborating with clients and internal teams to propose impactful system solutions and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively bring cross-functional teams together to shape user stories, acceptance criteria, process flows, and technical specifications (including API contracts, payload logic, and data mappings).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate data analysis, query system data to uncover edge cases, and map complex integration dependencies across backend architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project backlogs during discovery, build, and run phases, balancing business priorities against technical constraints, non-functional requirements (NFRs), and engineering effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and lead client discovery conversations, driving estimation efforts, facilitating workshops, and championing best practices across your project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2BkR3&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk to you if you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering both product-led user initiatives and complex technical projects (e.g., API integrations, platform migrations, data architecture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for a Consultancy or Client facing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience as a Technical Business Analyst working closely with engineering, architecture and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with&amp;nbsp;data, including data mapping, data models, databases and ideally SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of working alongside engineering teams to analyse data flows, system logic, and technical dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A user-centric mindset that ensures backend architectural choices directly support a seamless end-user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to bridge the gap between technical and non-technical stakeholders, gaining a deep understanding of business context and translating complex goals into clear. specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring meticulous requirements analysis, lead estimation efforts, and champion best practices across your project team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimented with AI tools to accelerate research, draft baseline specifications, map data fields, or red-team edge cases in system flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to or curiosity about how modern AI capabilities, LLMs, or agentic workflows integrate into backend system architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to exploring new tools and techniques that improve the speed and quality of business analysis, with a desire to share those learnings with colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You don’t need to arrive as an AI expert. If you haven’t yet had much opportunity to put AI into practice in your BA work, that shouldn’t stop you from applying. What matters to us is curiosity, a willingness to experiment, and a commitment to high-quality analysis. Everyone at CreateFuture undertakes AI-native training, and we’ll support you to build these capabilities and put them into practice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Business Analysts

Principal AI & Algorithms Engineer (Defence & Security) &lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an opportunity for a Principal Engineer in our AI &amp;amp; Algorithms department,&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;with a particular focus on our defence and security clients.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;join a team of talented engineers and scientists designing,&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;and testing intelligent systems that&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;one of the senior technical voices in the team,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;architecting the&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;algorithmic&amp;nbsp;approach on&amp;nbsp;our projects, setting the technical bar for others, and helping shape the work we&amp;nbsp;deliver.&amp;nbsp;As well as&amp;nbsp;hands-on engineering,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;spend time with clients, using your&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;to win new projects as well as deliver them.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;in multidisciplinary teams that use&amp;nbsp;our labs and computing resources&amp;nbsp;to enable us to deliver&amp;nbsp;ambitious&amp;nbsp;projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Much of our defence and security work requires&amp;nbsp;security clearance, so we ask for it up front. You&amp;nbsp;won’t&amp;nbsp;work exclusively in that sector, but a genuine interest in it matters to us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;offer a flexible approach to hybrid working, although some of the projects you will be working on will require&amp;nbsp;full-time working in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying data-driven software development in machine learning/AI, applied statistics, and sensor processing, alongside mathematical computing techniques such as digital signal processing, simulation, and numerical optimisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as technical lead and architect on our larger, more complex projects, owning the technical solution and the value it delivers to the client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting technical direction and acting as technical reviewer across the department, with your opinion&amp;nbsp;sought&amp;nbsp;by colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the development of proposals and costed work programmes, turning client problems into work we can win and deliver.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving internal capability and demonstrators that keep us at the leading edge and&amp;nbsp;open up&amp;nbsp;new conversations with clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers and conducting technical interviews to help us recruit and grow strong people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to how the department works, improving our processes and technical standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years’&amp;nbsp;experience designing and delivering&amp;nbsp;cutting&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;edge&amp;nbsp;algorithms&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;intelligent systems, including&amp;nbsp;working on defence or security projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills in one or more of:&amp;nbsp;transformer&amp;nbsp;models,&amp;nbsp;diffusion models, reinforcement learning, machine&amp;nbsp;vision&amp;nbsp;and perception.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;undergraduate degree&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a relevant technical subject, such as AI/machine learning, computer science,&amp;nbsp;mathematics&amp;nbsp;or,&amp;nbsp;physics. A PhD in a relevant subject is welcome but not&amp;nbsp;required; deep, demonstrable industrial&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;is what matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and software engineering judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to architect the technical approach on complex projects and to review the work of others, including working autonomously as the technical authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and developing engineers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working with non-technical stakeholders for your work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in&amp;nbsp;working directly with&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;and contributing to proposals and sales conversations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine affinity for working in the defence and security sector.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While not essential requirements, we would also be&amp;nbsp;very interested&amp;nbsp;if you have experience with any of the following:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical experience with any&amp;nbsp;of:&amp;nbsp;signal processing, edge computing, statistical modelling,&amp;nbsp;numerical optimisation, or simulation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record&amp;nbsp;of building client relationships and leading the technical side of sales campaigns and proposals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some projects at Cambridge Consultants are subject to security restrictions. This role requires you to obtain a Security Check (SC) level security clearance &amp;nbsp;( &lt;a id=&quot;menur1fij&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Security Vetting: Applicant&lt;/a&gt; ). You must be able to work in the UK without restrictions in accordance with UK National Law and be prepared to successfully undertake an appropriate level of UK National Security Vetting according to UK Government National Security Vetting criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that, for roles requiring Security Check clearance, applicants will typically need to have been a continuous resident in the UK for a minimum of 5 years immediately prior to applying for this role in order to meet the requirements for Security Check (SC) clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25&amp;nbsp;days&amp;nbsp;annual&amp;nbsp;leave&amp;nbsp;plus&amp;nbsp;bank&amp;nbsp;holidays&amp;nbsp;(with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;option&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;buy&amp;nbsp;10&amp;nbsp;more&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company&amp;nbsp;bonus&amp;nbsp;(profit&amp;nbsp;share)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;patterns&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;hybrid&amp;nbsp;working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical&amp;nbsp;insurance&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;group&amp;nbsp;income&amp;nbsp;protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;programme&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;mental&amp;nbsp;health&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;group&lt;/li&gt;
